{"id":"n31760-1-8","stage":2,"title":"정오 · 正午","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n31760-1-8-1","ko":"벌써 정오가 다 됐네.","zh":"已经快到中午了啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"벌써","meaning":"已经","explanation":"벌써：已经","readings":[{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58977","senseId":"1","lemma":"벌써","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"벌써","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3"}},{"text":"정오가","meaning":"正午","explanation":"정오：正午；가：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"정오","audio":"/audio/911285fb90eb70973968.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"31760","senseId":"1","lemma":"정오","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정오가","audio":"/audio/091cea0588c4e1294f31.mp3"}},{"text":"다","meaning":"快，就要","explanation":"다：快，就要","readings":[{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58176","senseId":"2","lemma":"다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"다","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3"}},{"text":"됐네.","meaning":"到","explanation":"되다：到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"3","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"됐네","audio":"/audio/c7af2764ef733ec3b2d8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"d038c1cb7ee215cb","term":"벌써","zh":"已经","audio":"/audio/d038c1cb7ee215cbfcee.mp3","entryId":"58977","definition":"比想象早地。","pronunciation":["벌써"]},{"id":"911285fb90eb7097","term":"정오","zh":"正午","audio":"/audio/911285fb90eb70973968.mp3","entryId":"31760","definition":"中午十二点。","pronunciation":["정ː오"]},{"id":"822b7db6f6886f57","term":"다","zh":"快，就要","audio":"/audio/822b7db6f6886f572413.mp3","entryId":"58176","definition":"动作或状态的程度似乎接近限定程度地。","pronunciation":["다ː"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"到","audio":"/audio/91b4